---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import Statement from '../components/Statement.astro';
import { business, plan, money } from '../data/business';

const title = 'How it works — Wardith';
const description =
  'How Wardith gets your business found by AI assistants: a £250 audit of where you stand, a one-off Foundation setup, and an ongoing monthly plan to keep you visible.';

const audit = plan('audit');
const foundation = plan('foundation');
const maintain = plan('maintain');

const howToSchema = {
  '@context': 'https://schema.org',
  '@type': 'Service',
  name: business.serviceName,
  serviceType: business.serviceType,
  provider: { '@id': new URL('/#organization', Astro.site).href },
  areaServed: business.areaServed,
  description:
    'Wardith audits how AI assistants such as ChatGPT, Google, Copilot and Perplexity currently answer questions about a business, fixes what is blocking the business from being found, and maintains that visibility month to month.',
};
---
<Base title={title} description={description} schema={[howToSchema]}>
<section class="hero hero--rules"><div class="wrap"><p class="section-label">The work behind the recommendation</p><h1>Ask. Investigate.<br /><em>Act on the evidence.</em></h1><p class="lede">We test what the assistants say, examine the information they can find, and separate the things you can improve from the things you can’t control.</p></div></section>
<section class="section"><div class="wrap audit-grid"><div><p class="section-label">01 / The audit</p><h2>Your business.<br />A repeatable test.</h2><p>We ask ten questions your customers would ask, across the major assistants. Repeated runs reveal variation that a single answer can miss.</p><p>Then we check your website and the public facts about your business. You receive the recorded answers and our assessment of what needs attention.</p><p class="micro">{money(audit.price)} one-off. The report is yours to act on yourself, take to another provider, or bring back to us.</p></div><div class="report-preview"><p class="section-label">What we examine</p><ol class="report-contents"><li><span>01</span><div><strong>The answers</strong><p>Whether you appear, what is said about you, and who else gets named.</p></div></li><li><span>02</span><div><strong>Your website</strong><p>Whether crawlers can access it and the pages answer relevant customer questions.</p></div></li><li><span>03</span><div><strong>Your public information</strong><p>Your business details across directories, profiles and relevant registers.</p></div></li><li><span>04</span><div><strong>Your next decision</strong><p>What is worth fixing, with the evidence for that recommendation.</p></div></li></ol></div></div></section>
<section class="section section--tint"><div class="wrap split"><div><p class="section-label">02 / Foundation</p><h2>Put the findings<br />to work.</h2></div><div><p>The {money(foundation.price)} Foundation works on your existing website. It covers crawler access, structured business information, consistent facts across the web, and two permanent pages answering questions selected by the audit.</p><p>We agree a plan and date after payment. You provide website access and the business details needed to make the work accurate.</p><details class="disclose"><summary>What if my website needs different work?</summary><p>The report tells you. We don’t sell a website rebuild or take a referral fee from a developer you choose. If Foundation would be wasted on your site as it stands, we say so.</p></details></div></div></section>
<section class="section"><div class="wrap split"><div><p class="section-label">03 / Optional ongoing work</p><h2>Watch the answers.<br />Respond to change.</h2></div><div><p>From {money(maintain.price)} per month. Maintain checks ten questions and keeps your facts current. Grow covers fifteen questions with one new answer page each month. Lead covers twenty-five, adds two pages, and includes a quarterly competitor review.</p><p>Each month gives you a written record of where you appeared and the gaps that remain. You can change plans or stop before your next payment date.</p><a class="text-link" href="/pricing/">Compare the monthly plans <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div></div></section>
<section class="section section--invert"><div class="wrap split"><div><h2>What we can promise.</h2></div><div><p>A documented process, recorded answers, and recommendations tied to what we found. AI assistants choose their own answers; no provider can promise that they will recommend you.</p><a class="text-link" href="/ask-your-ai/self-audit/">Inspect our original self-audit <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div></div></section>
</Base>
